{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19184","headline":"酬令狐相公赠别 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越声长苦有谁闻，老向湘山与楚云。\n海峤新辞永嘉守，夷门重见信陵君。\n田园松菊今迷路，霄汉鸳鸿久绝羣。\n幸遇甘泉尚词赋，不知何客荐雄文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}